  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6105.04 Minimum Age",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6105.04 Minimum Age. Pursuant to RSA 270-D:13, IV, an individual who has successfully completed a safe boater education course or safe boater equivalency examination after reaching the age of 15 shall be issued a safe boater education certificate upon attaining the age of 16 and upon fulfilling the requirements in Saf-C 6105.01.\n\nSource. #7650, eff 2-20-02; rpld by #7975, eff 10-20-03; ss by #9472, eff 5-18-09 (formerly Saf-C 6105.05); ss by #12467, eff 1-25-18",
